Z||000005||PJ||09-15-2000||07:59 PM||||Black88GT:<P>Did the stock Beretta GTZ box come with the Torsen diff? Last time I checked the list price for just the diff at the parts counter it was over $2,000. Seems kinda expensive compared to what the cars were selling for new at the time. I once bought a Getrag out of a Grand Am the same age as the GTZ. It sure didn't have a LSD. If it did it would of been like Christmas.<P>PJ<BR>ITA #66 Black ('88 GT)<BR>||||reg||1
